#NEXUS

[ göhlich2006a_fig4: Theropod cladogram. The numbered circles 1-24 are keys, not names. MANIRAPTORA's box spans exactly one clade (node 7, Ornitholestes to Confuciusornis) and is kept as an internal label; COELUROSAURIA's box covers the Albertosaurus-Tyrannosaurus pair and node 5, which are not one clade (node 3 also holds the Allosaurus-Sinraptor pair), so it is not encoded. Polytomies: node 3 (the Allosaurus pair, the tyrannosaurid pair and node 5) and node 12 (four compsognathids). Replacement for cau2018a_fig6 (seed 20261202). 28 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 4 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 4 case (census 2, seed 20261201). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=28;
    TAXLABELS
        Coelophysis
        Dilophosaurus
        Allosaurus
        Sinraptor
        Albertosaurus
        Tyrannosaurus
        Compsognathus
        Sinosauropteryx
        Huaxiagnathus
        Juravenator
        Shenzhousaurus
        Gallimimus
        Ornithomimus
        Ornitholestes
        Patagonykus
        Shuvuuia
        Mononykus
        Caudipteryx
        Conchoraptor
        Citipati
        Sinovenator
        Troodon
        Saurornithoides
        Microraptor
        Velociraptor
        Sinornithosaurus
        Archaeopteryx
        Confuciusornis
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE 'göhlich2006a_fig4' = [&R] (Coelophysis,(Dilophosaurus,((Allosaurus,Sinraptor),(Albertosaurus,Tyrannosaurus),((Compsognathus,Sinosauropteryx,Huaxiagnathus,Juravenator),((Shenzhousaurus,(Gallimimus,Ornithomimus)),(Ornitholestes,((Patagonykus,(Shuvuuia,Mononykus)),((Caudipteryx,(Conchoraptor,Citipati)),(((Sinovenator,(Troodon,Saurornithoides)),(Microraptor,(Velociraptor,Sinornithosaurus))),(Archaeopteryx,Confuciusornis)))))Maniraptora)))));
END;
